{"words": [{"text": "رَبَّنَا", "translation": "Our Lord"}, {"text": "وَٱجْعَلْنَا", "translation": "[and] Make us"}, {"text": "مُسْلِمَيْنِ", "translation": "both submissive"}, {"text": "لَكَ", "translation": "to You"}, {"text": "وَمِن", "translation": "And from"}, {"text": "ذُرِّيَّتِنَآ", "translation": "our offspring"}, {"text": "أُمَّةًۭ", "translation": "a community"}, {"text": "مُّسْلِمَةًۭ", "translation": "submissive"}, {"text": "لَّكَ", "translation": "to You"}, {"text": "وَأَرِنَا", "translation": "And show us"}, {"text": "مَنَاسِكَنَا", "translation": "our ways of worship"}, {"text": "وَتُبْ", "translation": "and turn"}, {"text": "عَلَيْنَآ ۖ", "translation": "to us"}, {"text": "إِنَّكَ", "translation": "Indeed You"}, {"text": "أَنتَ", "translation": "[You] (are)"}, {"text": "ٱلتَّوَّابُ", "translation": "the Oft-returning"}, {"text": "ٱلرَّحِيمُ", "translation": "the Most Merciful"}], "sahih": "Our Lord, and make us Muslims [in submission] to You and from our descendants a Muslim nation [in submission] to You. And show us our rites [of worship] and accept our repentance. Indeed, You are the Accepting of Repentance, the Merciful."}